cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "SSSOM rendered as RDF named graphs and RDF 1.2"
abstract: >-
  Rendering SSSOM ontology-mapping sets into two complementary RDF
  serializations — named graphs (TriG) and RDF 1.2 (Turtle-star triple
  terms) — with tooling to serve them via Oxigraph and query them via
  Comunica. Produced at the GOBLIN track of the Oviedo BioHackathon 2026.
type: software
